; Sonic (GX4000): the ring route at the emulated times AMSpiriT Lite 1.16.0 played
; rings_amspirit.csl (made by ../../tools/amspirit_replay.py from its log). Sonic runs right,
; jumps, takes rings, loses them on the spikes (scattered rings: multiplexed sprites).
; amspirit_1.16.0/ holds AMSpiriT's shots of some of these frames.
